{
  "id": "2TI.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "2TI",
  "reference": "2 Timoteo 2",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2TI 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wange Timotheo, ekisha ekyo twigiliirwe aha rw'okushangwa tujwangaine na Yesu Kirisito kikugumise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebyo wampuliire ningamba omu maisho g'abajulizi batali bake, obyegese bwegesa abantu abalikwesigwa abarashobora nabo kwegesa abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oikilize kushasha nk'omwisherukare wa Yesu Kirisito omwesigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taliho mwisherukare omu bwisherukarebwe ayetahya omu mirolere y'abatali baisherukare, enshonga wenene omugendelerogwe ni kushemeleza ayamuhandikire omu bwisherukare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunzani w'emizano y'okwiruka tibamujweka rukinga, shana kayakusindana ahondeire amateka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulimi w'ekihika niwe asana kuhaba omugabo gwa mbere aha myaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo ndikugamba obiteke aha mutima, kuba Omukama naija kukuha okushobokerwa byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oijuke Yesu Kirisito ayahimbukire omu bafu, alikutabuka ahali Daudi, nk'okwo bili omu vangeli eyo ndanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo niyo vangeli eyo balikuntura, nkajwara n'empingo okw'obona enkoramahano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo ninteekanira buli kantu aha rw'abantu endonkwa za Ruhanga, babone kurokoka bajwangaine na Yesu Kirisito, babone n'ekitiinwa eky'eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo eki ky'amazima:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo ote nobibaijukya, obaragire nobataho Omukama, bate nibatantara ebigambo by'empaka ebitaina mugasho, aha orw'okuba nk'ebyo binaga abalikubihulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okore okw'olikushobora kuba murungi ahali Ruhanga, obe mukozi atalikwebabara kantu, n'ekigambo ky'amazima okyegese kabutekire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyelinde enkuru etainamu kakutiina Ruhanga, nobona enkuru egyo neija kwikara nehindura abantu okutetaho Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkuru egi neija kubatemura nk'ekishebe. Omuli bonene abo halimu Himenayo na Fileto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nibo basigiliire amazima bakagamba ngu okuhimbuka kurabaireho. Nibaita okwikiliza kw'abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe omusingi gwa Ruhanga ogugumire nigwo gwonene gwonene, gwina n'omuhuri ogu: “Omukama namanya abaliba wenene,” kandi, “Kaishe muntu araba namanya okwo wenene aba wa Mukama alekere okufakara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nju mpango tabamu bikwato bya zahabu na feza byonkai. Habamu n'eby'emiti n'eby'eibumba. Haliho ebyo bakoza emilimo ey'ekitinwa, kandi ebindi babikoza emilimo elikugaywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'omuntu arachwa emize mibi, aho araba kikwato ky'omulimo ogw'ekitinwa, ogutakatifu ogw'omugasho ahali nyin'enju, ekikwato ekyo yakukikoza omulimo gurungi Aha kaanya kona kona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo oyetange amairu g'obusigazi, oitanire obugorogoki, okwesiga, engonzi n'emilembe, hamoi na bona abatakira Omukama n'omutima gulikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empaka z'obufera ezitaina mugasho ozileke; nomanya okwo zizarukanwamu enkungana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara omukozi wa Ruhanga naragirwa kutaba muntu wa nkungana. Agilire buli muntu obufura, abe mwegesa ayolekeize, abe mwegumisiliza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abalikumuhakanisa abahabuze n'obuchulezi. Rundi Ruhanga yakusinga baija bechuza bamanya amazima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bahunga aha mutego gwa Sitani ayabaire abazimatiire, babone kukora ebyo Ruhanga ayenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
